Applies the soft shrinkage function element-wise.

    .. math::
        \text{SoftShrinkage}(x) =
        \begin{cases}
        x - \lambda, & \text{ if } x > \lambda \\
        x + \lambda, & \text{ if } x < -\lambda \\
        0, & \text{ otherwise }
        \end{cases}

    Args:
